sections.body:
```json
{
  "EntityRef": {
    "Mode": "SingleTenantDefault",
    "DefaultTenantId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
  },
  "PostgresAudit": { "Tenancy": { "Mode": "MultiTenantStrict" } },
  "PostgresChangeTracker": { "Tenancy": { "Mode": "SystemOnly" } },
  "PostgresFavorite": { }
}
```

Bind `EntityRefOptions` once at the host with `AddEntityRefOptionsFromConfiguration`. Each module's `Extensions.cs` binds its own `Postgres*Options`
section.
